---
id: sidebar-split
category: Interfaz (Electron)
title: Barra lateral colapsable
language: html
description: Layout con barra lateral que se oculta con un botón. Solo HTML, CSS y JS.
params: width=240|Ancho en px
---
<div class="layout">
  <aside id="sidebar" class="sidebar">Barra lateral</aside>
  <main class="content">
    <button id="toggle-sidebar">☰</button>
    Contenido
  </main>
</div>
<style>
  .layout { display: flex; height: 100vh; }
  .sidebar { width: {{width}}px; transition: margin-left .2s; overflow: auto; border-right: 1px solid #333; }
  .sidebar.collapsed { margin-left: -{{width}}px; }
  .content { flex: 1; min-width: 0; }
</style>
<script>
  document.getElementById('toggle-sidebar').addEventListener('click', () => {
    document.getElementById('sidebar').classList.toggle('collapsed')
  })
</script>
